Same as with stairs and magic portals and teleporters and such, have 
them near you when you fall through. As in (assuming you have a dog for 
a pet):
d^@
you move west and are next to your pet dog when you fall through. Of 
course, with multiple pets, this might take a while, if you can't get 
them all next to the traphole. In which case you'll just have to ferry 
them down one by one.

